Error [jet.UnknownName]: `total` is used here before the script sets it on line 5
  --> tests/ui/script_lambda_reads_binding_below.jet:3:22
    |
  3 | show := fn() { print(total) }
    |                      ^^^^^
  --> tests/ui/script_lambda_reads_binding_below.jet:5:1
    |
  5 | total: 5
    | ^^^^^ `total` is set here
 Why: The script's lines run in order, and this use comes before line 5, which sets `total`
 Fix: Move this use below line 5, or set `total` above it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107
